    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0600_oldwoman_02",
      "hash": "54f657f5b7b738eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0600_oldwoman_03",
      "hash": "54f656f5b7b73738",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_01",
      "hash": "2bf9b58d7de5c4d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小刚：噢！\\n没想到会在这里见到你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_02",
      "hash": "2bf9b48d7de5c31f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我现在正好\\n要从玉虹道馆回去！\\c\\n因为道馆馆主之间互相交流\\n也是我工作的重要一环嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_03",
      "hash": "2bf9b38d7de5c16c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽然我\\n莫名其妙地就被撵出来了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_04",
      "hash": "2bf9b28d7de5bfb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "对了，我带来的土产，\\n这个深灰米果，\\r\\n也送给[VAR TRNAME(0000)]吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_01",
      "hash": "b2b5b4f4538dbccc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从小刚那里\\n得到了深灰米果！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_05",
      "hash": "2bf9b18d7de5be06",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是说……！\\n深灰米果吃了会渴的。\\r\\n一旦入口你就会想喝茶了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0600_sys_02",
      "hash": "b2b5b7f4538dc1e5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从小刚那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]茶[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_07",
      "hash": "2bf9af8d7de5baa0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，原本准备要送一份给\\n口渴的警卫的。\\c\\n这样一来就没得送了呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0600_rock_06",
      "hash": "2bf9b08d7de5bc53",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……话说！看来你正在造访\\n各地的宝可梦道馆啊！\\r\\n我会为你加油的！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
